WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.575
A click runs a function you hand to add Event Listener.

2
00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:07.227
A heading to change, and a button to click.

3
00:00:07.927 --> 00:00:11.602
A function holds the change. Writing it does not run it.

4
00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:17.002
add Event Listener runs start on a click. No brackets: we hand it over.

5
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:22.966
Nothing has changed: the page is waiting for a click.

6
00:00:26.132 --> 00:00:29.032
The click ran start, and the heading changed.
